{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1517.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"fe32578d8792b6378335f7c950355e223e258d42e42319c50b7585d94d059169","ja":"甘酒と初夢","zh":"甘酒与初梦","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1517.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"6474a3d5c43c1752ee26f1883fe90d59939161f71ac0fd449d857dfc7acc843b","ja":"みんな～！\nあけましておめでとうだヨ～♪","zh":"大家～！\n新年快乐呀～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1517.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"51991d2e635a5a929880015bc403f6f47b8d728b08b34464dc932386070cb878","ja":"ふふ、エレナは年が明けても元気ですわね。\nこちらこそ、今年もよろしくお願いいたしますわ。","zh":"呵呵，艾莲娜跨了年也还是这么精神呢。\n我也一样，今年也请多多关照了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1517.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"64fdb7e88558a3f355b4ac2fabdeec3b49b2f8b55f9439d55f9b5c4b810ef321","ja":"そうだ、●●●●プロデューサーが、\n甘酒を用意してくれてるんだけど、エレナも飲む？","zh":"对了，●●●●制作人\n准备了甜酒酿，艾莲娜要喝吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1517.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"69b75761412fdc20415a38abd6054a9305907eef06ac1c715b18f67fefc874c7","ja":"わぁ、ありがとうマコト！　ふぅ～、ふぅ～……ん～♪\nあったかくて甘くて、とってもおいしいネ！","zh":"哇，谢谢你真！呼～，呼～……嗯～♪\n又暖又甜，非常好喝呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1517.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"1c8eb2c58847303ee5240eca67f4d3f96913f3c78d791699afab5932c45e97a5","ja":"……ふあ～あ……。体がポカポカになったら、\nなんだか眠くなってきちゃったヨ……。","zh":"……哈～啊……身体暖洋洋的，\n感觉有点想睡觉了呢……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1517.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"af8b57faba5abed11642ea179a88c24cff657112d5dd48220b0cf7ba2690b8b6","ja":"あら、寝不足ですの？\nさては、夜更かししてしまいましたわね？","zh":"哎呀，您睡眠不足吗？\n看样子，是熬夜了吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1517.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"04f52067aa5244b9dcf04847f26a015b722872e608d7cad79329b0ceef8c11ca","ja":"っていうか、実はゼンゼン寝てないんだヨ～。\n年が明けてから、ず～っとママンたちと起きてたノ。","zh":"话说，其实我完全没睡哦～。\n跨年之后，就一～直和妈妈她们醒着呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1517.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"56d45cfd2350cc4c18c8c30f3e0627cf2596269fffea17c0a3081b2d67571e37","ja":"お正月の特番とか面白いもんね。\nそれじゃあ、初夢もまだなんだ？","zh":"新年的特别节目确实很有意思呢。\n这么说来，你还没做初梦吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1517.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"f92097cb9c300a44c66dc0fb3bfacde9458e179d9970e37b1b7481f82df4b5f8","ja":"ウン。だから今日の夜が楽しみなんダ♪\nふたりはどんな初夢だったノ？","zh":"嗯。所以很期待今晚呢♪\n你们两个人做了什么样的初梦啊？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1517.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"4026fb5d965723d61beff380fe4edf967332df2c38b08e51ca7cb7d40d24d7eb","ja":"わたくしは、特に珍しい内容ではありませんでしたわ。\n初詣に行き、家でコタツに入ってのんびり過ごす……。","zh":"我这边倒是没什么稀罕的事。\n去新年参拜，然后窝在家的暖桌里悠闲度日……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1517.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"2e63b8ded1682b7770c81af641446b7714d62880cc16f4862f870d7242f13059","ja":"いつもと変わらな……ではなく！？\n庶民的な、元日の過ごし方を経験する夢でしたわ！？","zh":"和平常没什……不对！？\n我竟然做了一个体验平民般度过元旦的梦！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1517.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"652b84b20a79fef99265f7b386b2e6e4eaac5b89b39efb92432aa7213c9c54b0","ja":"セレブじゃないお正月をしている\nチヅルって、なんだか面白そうだネ♪","zh":"过着非名流版新年的\n千鹤，感觉挺有意思的呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1517.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"db57c8881411d4b211eecad9382be1500d43d6befa35651ca02ac4d2b5e52ed0","ja":"あっ、ボクのも聞いてよ！\nボクの初夢はね……。","zh":"啊，也听听我的吧！\n我的新年第一个梦是……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1517.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"10453cb76cf169a2e40f899df332a9eb978535d295bfd24a219491609c2fbe1b","ja":"フリフリの可愛いドレスを着て、\n大きなクマのぬいぐるみと、舞踏会をしていたんだ♪","zh":"穿上蓬松可爱的洋装，\n和巨大的熊玩偶一起举行了舞会哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1517.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"0465d84b25378b61b307d2b85c227805acf8ba8e1330edf127c8d10519da04c2","ja":"ワオ♪　ふたりとも、楽しそうな夢を\n見たんだネ。ワタシはどんな初夢を見るのかナ～？","zh":"哇哦♪　你们两个都做了个\n看起来很开心的梦呢。我不知会做什么样的初梦呢～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
